notes.notes:
[h1]- New party system[/h1]

Now up to 4 players can form a party. You can invite your team mates by clicking on the '+' symbols on the lobby or directly from the frendlist.

[h1]- New UI features[/h1]
[list][*] Brazilian Portuguese language support added;
[*] Minimap added;
[*] In game description of the skills (Tab key) added;
[*] Names of enemies and allies now have different collors;
[*] Language change option added to lobby;
[*] Small changes to the description of some skills.
[/list]

[h1]- AI[/h1]
[list][*] Bots of all heroes added;
[*] Behaviour of bots on squad mode improved.
[/list]

[h1]- General[/h1]
[list][*] Additional sound effects;
[*] Corrected bugs that could occur during matches.
[/list]
